  "problem": "MRF directory profiles could claim a sample exists for a blocked file. A query for negotiated rate files could lead with enforcement outcomes as a compatible file. Shared files could inflate provider coverage. An MRF sample could be treated as a complete hospital or payer publication. Sealed search lifecycle or coverage accounting could be edited.",
